Output demo/termos-demo.gif
Set Width 1440
Set Height 780
Set FontSize 17
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Theme "Dracula"

Type "./target/release/termos"
Enter
Sleep 1200ms

Type "/"
Type "web"
Sleep 900ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms

Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "g"
Sleep 700ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms

Type "c"
Sleep 900ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms

Type "q"
